			"Message": "chore(Wind): Regenerate generated artifacts with upstream source corrections\n\nRe-run Wind/Codegen to refresh generated TypeScript files after upstream VS Code source changes:\n- CommandCatalog drops from 551 to 550 entries, removing the `\"editor\"` command registered in `chat/electron-browser/chat.contribution.ts:340` that was removed upstream\n- ServiceCatalog grows from 500 to 502 entries, adding IChatViewFactory and ISessionsPartService to replace two stale SSH remote agent host service files that were superseded upstream\n- ISessionsManagementService gains a `setActive(session: IActiveSession): void` method reflecting new upstream API surface\n- Per-service upstream files (IAgentFeedbackService, IAgentHostGitService, ISSHRemoteAgentHostMainService, ISSHRemoteAgentHostService, IViewDescriptorService) have their source line references corrected to match the current VS Code source positions\n\nNo runtime behavioral changes — only generated scaffolding refreshed for build-time structural verification.",
